1
00:00:00,071 --> 00:00:03,001
(Sheldon:)I don't understand.

2
00:00:03,007 --> 00:00:04,907
(Leonard:)She's enjoying living with you

3
00:00:04,909 --> 00:00:06,909
(Leonard:)and she didn't want it
to end early.

4
00:00:06,911 --> 00:00:09,781
(Sheldon:)So, she's deceiving me

5
00:00:09,780 --> 00:00:12,250
(Sheldon:)in order to spend
more time with me.

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,250
(Raj(singing):)Yes.
Oh.

7
00:00:14,252 --> 00:00:18,722
(Sheldon:)Well, I feel both
flattered and hurt.

8
00:00:18,723 --> 00:00:20,253
(Sheldon:)Like when people say I
look like that skeleton

9
00:00:20,258 --> 00:00:23,858
from Nightmare Before Christmas.

10
00:00:23,861 --> 00:00:26,461
(Raj:)Oh my God, that's
who you look like.

11
00:00:27,832 --> 00:00:29,602
(Leonard:)Sheldon, this is not a big deal.

12
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,070
(Leonard:)It's a little white lie,
everyone does it.

13
00:00:31,068 --> 00:00:32,168
(Raj:)Not me,

14
00:00:32,169 --> 00:00:33,599
I'm a 100% honest

15
00:00:33,604 --> 00:00:35,204
(Raj:)in all of my
relationships.

16
00:00:35,206 --> 00:00:37,106
(Howard:)And how single
are you right now?

17
00:00:37,108 --> 00:00:40,848
Eating-cake-on-the-toilet
single.

18
00:00:42,613 --> 00:00:45,083
(Sheldon:)Well, I won't tolerate
deception in my relationship.

19
00:00:45,082 --> 00:00:47,012
(Sheldon:)I have no choice
but to confront her.

20
00:00:47,018 --> 00:00:49,888
(Howard:)Don't do that,
you've got gold here.

21
00:00:49,887 --> 00:00:51,587
(Howard:)Hang onto it until
you're in trouble

22
00:00:51,589 --> 00:00:53,959
(Sheldon:)and then...
throw it in her face.

23
00:00:53,958 --> 00:00:55,028
(Penny:)What?

24
00:00:55,026 --> 00:00:56,926
(Leonard:)Why would you tell him that?

25
00:00:56,928 --> 00:00:58,228
(Leonard:)That's terrible advice.

